  "bodySnippet": "About\nPrograms\nSuccess Stories\nBlog\nFree Tools\nSign In\nSchedule a Consult\nBecome a Bestselling\nAuthor Today\n\nWe’re the #1 resource for writing, self-publishing, and marketing books online.\n\nSchedule a Consult\n\nRECOGNIZED BY LEADING PLATFORMS AND INFLUENCERS IN PUBLISHING AND BUSINESS:\n\nHarness your expertise with a\nprofessionally published book\n\nBypass traditional publishing and reap the benefits of a high-quality book done your way.\n\n1:1 book coaching\n\nTime-saving writing tips\n\nDaily group training\n\nProfessional cover & formatting\n\nPublishing & launch plan\n\nReady to begin your selfpublishing.com experience?\nI'm Ready!\nWriting & publishing services\n\nCompare our programs here.\n\nPick the genre you plan to write to see your options:\n\nNonfictionFiction\n\nBecome a Bestseller\n\nWe teach you how to write & publish a book.\n\nWhat you get:\n\n1:1 Coaching\n\nBook Cover Design\n\nFormatting\n\nAmazon/KDP Upload\nAnd More\nLearn More\n\nAuthor Advantage Accelerator\n\nWe teach you how to write, publish, & market a book—we do the publishing.\n\nWhat you get:\n\n1:1 Coaching\n\nBook Cover Design\nFormatting\nAmazon/KDP Upload\nCategories & Keywords\nA+ Content\n\nBook Promo Campaign\n\nAnd More\n\nLearn More\n\nAuthor Accelerator Elite\n\nWe teach you how to write, publish, & market a book—we do the editing, publishing, &  marketing.\n\nWhat you get:\n\nEverything in Author Advantage Accelerator plus…\n\nProfessional Manuscript Editing\n\nBookBub & Goodreads Setup\n\nNY Times Square Takeover\n\nProfessional Book Trailer\n\nFeature on selfpublishing.com\n\nAnd More\n\nLearn More\n\nProfessional Ghostwriting\n\nWe do all the writing, editing, publishing, & marketing for your book.\n\nWhat you get:\n\n1:1 Interviews\n\nBook Positioning\n\nTranscriptions\n\nGhostwritten Manuscript\n\nProfessional Editing\n\nAll Book Production\n\nPublishing Support\n\nDone-for-You Marketing\n\nAI & Non-AI Options\n\nAnd More\nLearn More\nTake the next step toward your author goals\n\nWhether you want more support as you self-publish your book or you want an\nexperienced team to do it for you, selfpublishing.com is here to help.\n\nSchedule a Consultation\n\nSELFPUBLISHING.COM BY THE NUMBERS\n\nPROVEN SUCCESS STORIES\n1000s of bestsellers\n\nOur programs have helped authors achieve bestseller status,\nwith thousands of success stories across various genres.\n\nRead success stories >\n\nTHRIVING COMMUNITY\n\n250K+\n\nJoin an active community of over 250,000 members who support and inspire each other.\n\nCOUNTRIES PUBLISHED\n\n91+\n\nReach an international audience with our proven publishing method and services.\n\nGOOGLE RATING\n\n4.9+\n\nOur courses consistently receive high ratings, with an average Google rating of 4.9.\n\nREVENUE GROWTH\n\nMillions\n\nOur authors have earned millions in royalties and turned their books into wildly profitable businesses.\n\nDONE-FOR-YOU\nPublishing services\n\nLeverage the expertise of a professional team of coaches,\nghostwriters, and editors dedicated to your success.\n\nMeet our team >\n\nFree tools & resources\nQUIZ: Which publishing company is right for you?\nUnlimited ide",
